<%= digest.project.name %>: your week in AI answers

<%= digest.headline %>
<% digest.notices.forEach((n) => { %>
<%= n.title %> <%= n.text %>
<% }) -%>
<% if (digest.autopilotReady > 0 && locals.autopilotUrl) { %>
Review in Autopilot (you will be asked to sign in): <%- autopilotUrl %>
<% } %>
<% if (digest.figures.length) { %>
<% digest.figures.forEach((f) => { -%>
<%= f.label %>: <%= f.display %><% if (f.note) { %> (<%= f.note %>)<% } %>
<% }) -%>
<% } -%>
<% if (digest.changes.length) { %>
What changed
<% digest.changes.forEach((c) => { -%>
- <%= c.title %>. <%= c.text %>
<% }) -%>
<% } -%>
<% if (digest.proofs.length) { %>
A fix worked
<% digest.proofs.forEach((p) => { -%>
- <%= p %>
<% }) -%>
<% } -%>
<% if (digest.actions.length) { %>
What to do next
<% digest.actions.forEach((a, i) => { -%>
<%= i + 1 %>. <%= a.title %>
<% }) -%>
<% } %>
Open the dashboard:
<%- dashboardUrl %>

Change which emails you get: <%- settingsUrl %>
